art\u001b[39m, because a browser won't load\u001b[25;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cthe links from a page opened as a plain file.              \u001b[26;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- \u001b[1mBefore\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mit\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mcounts\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mas\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mdone,\u001b[m\u000f you'll open the page in both themes\u001b[27;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[4G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cand approve how it looks.\u001b[28;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[29;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CPress \u001b[38;5;153ma\u001b[39m in the panel to approve, or \u001b[38;5;153mc\u001b[39m to tell me what to       \u001b[30;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[2G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cchange.\u001b[31;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mWorked for 41s · done 7:49 PM\u001b[39m                                  \u001b[33;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mMake it two builders in a chain: a data role for links.json \u001b[39m   \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mfirst, then the page with its styles, which waits on data. \u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mCodex reviews each as it lands. Builders run with full access.\u001b[39m \u001b[49m\r\n                                                                 \u001b[38;5;174m\r\n·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mEmbel\u001b[38;5;216mlis\u001b[38;5;174mhing… \u001b[39m                                                 \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  Tip: Run /install-slack-app to use Claude in Slack\u001b[39m          \u001b[40;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[42;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r❯ \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[44;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;211m\u001b[C⏵⏵\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mbypass\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mpermissions\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mcycle)\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mesc\u001b[39m 