, so it wouldn't \u001b[25;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Ccatch someone later swapping in unsafe rendering. The page is  \u001b[26;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Csafe as written. I'll list this as an open finding at the MR   \u001b[27;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cgate rather than spend a fix round on it.                      \u001b[28;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBaked for 3m 27s · done 8:07 PM\u001b[39m                                \u001b[30;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mReview passed the whole branch. Open the MR gate.\u001b[39m              \u001b[49m\u001b[32;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(cat /home/tizh/repos/projects/troupe-demo/.troupe/worktree\r\n      s/link-page/review/.troupe/result.md; ls -la               \u001b[35;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[C/home/tizh/repos/projects/troupe-demo/.troupe/worktrees/l…)\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  Waiting…\u001b[39m                                                    \u001b[37;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;174m\r\n✶\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mPolishing… \u001b[38;5;246m(Checking git branch guard… · 2s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m231 tokens · \u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;246m\r\nthought for 1s)\u001b[39m                                                  \u001b[40;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[42;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r❯ \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[44;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;211m\u001b[C⏵⏵\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mbypass\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mpermissions\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mcycle)\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mesc\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246minter…\u001b[39m  \u001b[45;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[91C"]
