u001b[1m\u001b[COne\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mopen\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1msuggestion:\u001b[m\u000f add a test of the finished link list on   \u001b[28;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cthe page, not just the link data. My recommendation is to skip \u001b[29;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cit, since the page is safe as written. Say if you want it, and \u001b[30;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cit'll go back to the page role.                                \u001b[31;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[32;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CI'm counting your \"the page looks good\" as the look approval   \u001b[33;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cthe plan asks for. Nothing is pushed until you press \u001b[38;5;153ma\u001b[39m to      \u001b[34;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Capprove; \u001b[38;5;153mc\u001b[39m tells me what to change.                            \u001b[35;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 9s · done 8:11 PM\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[37;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n❯ mr-ok approved in the panel. Open the PR, then run troupe      \r\n  stage merged -m link-page and troupe gate merged -m link-page  \r\n  \"<the PR link>\". Keep the role windows: the person may ask     \u001b[42;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[2G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cfor changes before merging.\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[44;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;211m\u001b[C⏵⏵\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mbypass\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mpermissions\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mcycle)\u001b[39m                  \u001b[45;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[91C"]
