t it, and \u001b[26;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cit'll go back to the page role.                                \u001b[27;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[28;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CI'm counting your \"the page looks good\" as the look approval   \u001b[29;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cthe plan asks for. Nothing is pushed until you press \u001b[38;5;153ma\u001b[39m to      \u001b[30;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Capprove; \u001b[38;5;153mc\u001b[39m tells me what to change.                            \u001b[31;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 9s · done 8:11 PM\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[33;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mmr-ok approved in the panel. Open the PR, then run troupe \u001b[39m     \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mstage merged -m link-page and troupe gate merged -m link-page \u001b[39m \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m\"<the PR link>\". Keep the role windows: the person may ask for\u001b[39m \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mchanges before merging.\u001b[39m                                        \u001b[49m\u001b[38;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;174m\r\n*\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mCultivating… \u001b[39m                                                  \u001b[40;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[42;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r❯ \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[44;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;211m\u001b[C⏵⏵\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mbypass\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mpermissions\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mcycle)\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mesc\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246minter…\u001b[39m  \u001b[45;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[91C"]
