[1514.589242, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[H✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed for 9s · done 8:11 PM\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[2;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mmr-ok approved in the panel. Open the PR, then run troupe \u001b[39m     \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mstage merged -m link-page and troupe gate merged -m link-page \u001b[39m \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m\"<the PR link>\". Keep the role windows: the person may ask for\u001b[39m \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231mchanges before merging.\u001b[39m                                        \u001b[49m\u001b[7;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe stage mr -m link-page && git push -u origin        \u001b[9;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cmission/link-page 2>&1 | tail -3 && gh pr list --state all \r\n      --limit 3 --json number,title,headRefName)                 \u001b[11;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r  ⎿  \u001b[39mStage: mr\u001b[12;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[CTo github.com:tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo.git                \r\n      * [new branch]      mission/link-page -> mission/link-     \u001b[14;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\u001b[C… +15 lines (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u000f                              \u001b[15;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(gh pr create --base main --head mission/link-page --title \u001b[17;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[C\"Link page with a dark mode\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'         \r\n      Turns the bare \"My links\" page into a small static…)       \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  \u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=tmux1FA;https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b\\https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\        \u001b[20;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[5G\u001b[1K\u001b[CStage: merged\u001b[21;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe gate merged -m link-page                           \u001b[23;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[C\"https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\"     \r\n      --no-wait)                                                 \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  \u001b[39mOpened gate merged                                          \u001b[26;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n●\u001b[39m I've opened the pull request:                                  \u001b[28;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=tmux1FA;https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b\\\u001b[Chttps://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\           \u001b[29;65H\u001b[1K\r\n  The mission branch is pushed, and the \"merged\" gate is open in \r\n  the panel with that link. The role windows are still open. If  \u001b[32;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cyou want changes before merging, I'll send them to the same    \u001b[33;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cbuilder and push the fix to the same PR. Once you've merged it,\u001b[34;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Capprove the gate and I'll clean up the mission's windows,      \u001b[35;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[2G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cworktrees and role branches.\u001b[36;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mWorked for 16s · done\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m8:12\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mPM\u001b[39m                                  \u001b[38;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\n❯ merged approved in the panel. Run troupe stage teardown -m     \r\n  link-page and troupe teardown -m link-page, then report the    \u001b[42;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Ccleanup.                                                       \u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[44;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;211m\u001b[C⏵⏵\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mbypass\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mpermissions\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;211mon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mto\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mcycle)\u001b[39m                  \u001b[45;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[91C"]
