[1517.554108, "o", "\u001b[1;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[C\u001b[1mOne\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mopen\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1msuggestion:\u001b[m\u000f add a test of the finished link list on the page, not just the link data. My recommendation is to skip it, since the page is safe as\u001b[K\u001b[2;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cwritten. Say if you want it, and it'll go back to the page role.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[4;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CI'm counting your \"the page looks good\" as the look approval the plan asks for. Nothing is pushed until you press \u001b[38;5;153ma\u001b[39m to approve; \u001b[38;5;153mc\u001b[39m tells me what to change.\u001b[5;1H\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[6d\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[CBrewed\u001b[Cfor\u001b[C9s\u001b[C·\u001b[Cdone\u001b[C8:11\u001b[CPM\u001b[8;1H\u001b[48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mmr-ok approved in the panel. Open the PR, then run troupe stage merged -m link-page and troupe gate merged -m link-page \"<the PR link>\". Keep the role \u001b[39m   \u001b[9;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mwindows: the person may ask for changes before merging.\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \u001b[11;1H\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe\u001b[Cstage\u001b[Cmr\u001b[C-m\u001b[Clink-page\u001b[C&&\u001b[Cgit\u001b[Cpush\u001b[C-u\u001b[Corigin\u001b[Cmission/link-page\u001b[C2>&1\u001b[C|\u001b[Ctail\u001b[C-3\u001b[C&&\u001b[Cgh\u001b[Cpr\u001b[Clist\u001b[C--state\u001b[Call\u001b[C--limit\u001b[C3\u001b[C--json\u001b[12;7Hnumber,title,headRefName)\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001