[1517.658076, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mBrewed\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mfor\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m9s\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mdone\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m8:11\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mPM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mmr-ok approved in the panel. Open the PR, then run troupe stage merged -m link-page and troupe gate merged -m link-page \"<the PR link>\". Keep the role \u001b[39m   \u001b[5;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mwindows: the person may ask for changes before merging.\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[6;1H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe stage mr -m link-page && git push -u origin mission/link-page 2>&1 | tail -3 && gh pr list --state all --limit 3 --json\u001b[K\u001b[8;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cnumber,title,headRefName)\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m⎿\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39mStage: mr\u001b[K\u001b[10;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[CTo github.com:tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo.git\u001b[K\u001b[11;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[C* [new branch]      mission/link-page -> mission/link-page\u001b[K\u001b[12;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\u001b[C…\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m+13\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2mlines\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m(ctrl+o\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2mto\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2mexpand)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(gh pr create --base main --head mission/link-page --title \"Link page with a dark mode\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\u001b[K\u001b[15;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[CTurns the bare \"My links\" page into a small static…)\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m⎿\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=tmux1FA;https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b\\https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\u001b[17;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[CStage: merged\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe gate merged -m link-page \"https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\" --no-wait)\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m⎿\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39mOpened gate merged\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n●\u001b[39m I've opened the pull request: \u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=tmux1FA;https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b\\https://github.com/tianqizhao0704/troupe-demo/pull/3\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[24;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CThe mission branch is pushed, and the \"merged\" gate is open in the panel with that link. The role windows are still open. If you want changes before\u001b[K\u001b[25;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cmerging, I'll send them to the same builder and push the fix to the same PR. Once you've merged it, approve the gate and I'll clean up the mission's\u001b[K\u001b[26;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cwindows, worktrees and role branches.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mWorked\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mfor\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m16s\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mdone\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m8:12\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mPM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mmerged approved in the panel. Run troupe stage teardown -m link-page and troupe teardown -m link-page, then report the cleanup.\u001b[39m                           \u001b[49m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(cd /home/tizh/repos/projects/troupe-demo && gh pr view 3 --json state,mergedAt; troupe stage teardown -m link-page && troupe teardown -m link-page)\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m⎿\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[39m{\u001b[K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[C\"mergedAt\": \"2026-10-26T19:13:45Z\",\u001b[K\r\n       \"state\"